From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:56:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/31] seqpar: bf16-wire hc_mixed all-gathers
 (LLAMA_SEQPAR_GATHER_BF16=1)

ggml_all_gather_wire(ctx, a, wire) records the wire format in op_params[0]
(1 = bf16, F32 only). qwen4exp uses it for the two per-layer hc_mixed gathers
when LLAMA_SEQPAR_GATHER_BF16=1 (default off); the residual-stream gathers
stay F32. The CUDA copy-engine gather stages each slice as bf16 in the own
ce_buf, ships it through ce_tmp2 with the existing event protocol, and widens
it on every rank, own slice included, so the gathered tensor is the same
fp32(bf16(x)) on both GPUs (the rounding the BF16 GEMMs apply to src1).

GGML_SEQPAR_GATHER_ROUND=1 (control) keeps the F32 wire and rounds in place;
GGML_SEQPAR_GATHER_CHUNK caps the chunk (test). The meta generic gather warns
once when it serves a bf16-wire gather unrounded.

Production-model KLD 0.0138, equal to the rounding-only control; prefill
+2.6..3.0 % (FINDINGS 907).
